+---
+id: task-005-add-rental-booking-cancellation
+type: task
+title: "Add rental booking cancellation"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service. It returns the booking id and refund in euro cents.
+A cancellation made at least 24 hours before the booking starts receives a full refund; a later
+cancellation receives no refund. A cancelled booking releases its equipment, and a booking can only
+be cancelled once. Update the rental service documentation and cover cancellation, refund boundaries,
+unknown ids, duplicate cancellation, and released availability.
